---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/layout/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/layout/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Stockade"
  description="Learn how Stockade handles your data. No personal information is collected — all simulation state is stored locally in your browser."
>
  <Navbar />

  <main class="max-w-[760px] mx-auto px-6 py-16">

    <div class="mb-10">
      <div class="text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-[#f59e0b] mb-3">Legal</div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[var(--c-text)] mb-3">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-[13px] font-mono text-[var(--c-text-subtle)]">Last updated: August 11, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose-legal">

      <section>
        <h2>Overview</h2>
        <p>
          Stockade ("we", "us", or "our") operates the website stockademarketsim.com (the "Service"). This page
          informs you of our policies regarding the collection, use, and disclosure of personal data when
          you use our Service. We are committed to protecting your privacy. In short: <strong>we collect
          no personally identifiable information</strong> and have no user accounts.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Data We Collect</h2>

        <h3>No Account Required</h3>
        <p>
          Stockade requires no registration, login, or email address. You can use every feature of the
          platform without providing any personal information to us.
        </p>

        <h3>Local Storage (Client-Side Only)</h3>
        <p>
          Your trading simulation state — including your virtual portfolio balance, trade history,
          preferences such as dark/light mode, and other settings — is stored exclusively in your
          browser's <code>localStorage</code>. This data never leaves your device and is never
          transmitted to our servers. You can clear it at any time by clearing your browser's site data.
        </p>

        <h3>Usage Data</h3>
        <p>
          We may collect anonymised, aggregated usage data (such as page views and session counts)
          through standard web analytics tools. This data cannot be used to identify you and is used
          solely to understand how the Service is used and to improve it.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>

        <h3>Google Fonts</h3>
        <p>
          Stockade uses fonts (Inter and JetBrains Mono) served by Google Fonts. When your browser
          requests these fonts, your IP address is sent to Google's servers. Please refer to
          <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            Google's Privacy Policy
          </a> for details on how they handle that data.
        </p>

        <h3>Google Analytics</h3>
        <p>
          We use Google Analytics to understand how the Service is used in aggregate, reporting
          anonymised metrics such as page views and session counts. It stores analytics cookies only
          if you consent to them. See
          <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            Google's Privacy Policy
          </a>.
        </p>

        <h3>Google AdSense</h3>
        <p>
          We use Google AdSense to display advertising. Advertising cookies are stored, and
          personalised ads shown, only if you consent to them. See
          <a href="#advertising-and-cookies">Advertising and Cookies</a> below for how advertising
          cookies work and how to opt out of personalised ads.
        </p>

        <h3>Google Consent Mode</h3>
        <p>
          We signal your cookie choice to Google using Google Consent Mode. Your decision is applied to
          analytics storage, advertising storage, advertising personalisation, and the sharing of ad
          user data. Until you accept, all four are set to denied.
        </p>

        <h3>Hosting</h3>
        <p>
          The site is hosted on a third-party web hosting provider. Standard web server logs (IP
          address, browser type, referring URL, timestamp) may be retained by the hosting provider in
          accordance with their own privacy policy.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          Cookies are small text files that a website stores on your device to remember information
          about you between visits. Similar technologies — such as <code>localStorage</code> and web
          beacons — work in much the same way.
        </p>

        <h3>Essential Use</h3>
        <p>
          Stockade uses local browser storage for the functionality of the Service itself: your virtual
          portfolio, trade history, theme preference, and your cookie consent choice. These are strictly
          necessary for the site to work as intended and are never used to track you across other
          websites.
        </p>

        <h3>Advertising and Analytics</h3>
        <p>
          Stockade also uses cookies for analytics and for advertising. These are not essential to the
          operation of the site, so they are not set unless you consent to them. On your first visit you
          will see a consent banner. Until you accept, our advertising and analytics providers run in a
          restricted mode in which they store no cookies on your device, do not build an advertising
          profile from your activity, and serve only non-personalised ads.
        </p>

        <h3>Your Choice</h3>
        <p>
          If you decline, that restricted mode stays in effect permanently: no analytics or advertising
          cookies are stored and no personalised advertising is shown. You may still see
          non-personalised ads, which are chosen from the content of the page rather than from your
          browsing history.
        </p>
        <p>
          You can change your mind at any time by clearing your browser's site data for
          stockademarketsim.com, which will bring the consent banner back on your next visit. You can
          also block or delete cookies through your browser settings, though doing so may affect how
          parts of the Service behave.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 id="advertising-and-cookies">Advertising and Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          This site uses third-party vendors, including Google, to serve ads based on a user's prior
          visits to this website or other websites. Google's use of advertising cookies enables Google
          and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visits to this site and/or other sites on
          the internet.
        </p>
        <p>
          Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits
          to this website or other websites. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its
          partners to serve ads to users based on their visit to this site and/or other sites on the
          internet.
        </p>
        <p>
          These cookies allow ad networks to recognise your browser or device across visits, and to build
          a profile of your interests based on your browsing activity, in order to show you ads that are
          more relevant to you.
        </p>

        <h3>Opting Out</h3>
        <p>
          Users may opt out of personalised advertising by visiting
          <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            Google's Ads Settings
          </a>. Alternatively, users can opt out of some third-party vendor use of cookies for
          personalised advertising by visiting
          <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            www.aboutads.info
          </a> or the
          <a href="https://optout.networkadvertising.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            Network Advertising Initiative opt-out page
          </a>.
        </p>

        <h3>Scope</h3>
        <p>
          This Privacy Policy covers our own use of cookies. It does not cover the use of cookies or
          other tracking technologies by any advertisers or third-party ad networks.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          Our Service does not address anyone under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personally
          identifiable information from children under 13. If you are a parent or guardian and believe
          your child has provided us with personal data, please contact us.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Links to Other Sites</h2>
        <p>
          Our Service may contain links to third-party websites. We have no control over and assume no
          responsibility for the content, privacy policies, or practices of any third-party sites or
          services.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by
          updating the "Last updated" date at the top of this page. You are advised to review this page
          periodically.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at
          <a href="mailto:hello@stockademarketsim.com">hello@stockademarketsim.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .prose-legal {
    color: var(--c-text-muted);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .prose-legal section {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--c-border);
  }
  .prose-legal section:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }
  .prose-legal h2 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--c-text);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .prose-legal h3 {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--c-text);
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
  .prose-legal p {
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
  }
  .prose-legal a {
    color: #f59e0b;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }
  .prose-legal a:hover {
    color: #fbbf24;
  }
  .prose-legal code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85em;
    background: var(--c-bg-muted);
    border: 1px solid var(--c-border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 0.1em 0.35em;
    color: var(--c-text);
  }
  .prose-legal strong {
    color: var(--c-text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
